    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "THE GREAT WALL OF CHINA\nDONG KINGMAN",
      "C\nTHE GREAT WALL OF CHINA\nDong Kingman, the award winning Chinese-American artist, travels the world sketching and painting\nthe beautiful, the monumental and the picturesque. His watercolors grace more than forty\npermanent museum and private collections in the USA and abroad.\nIn the mountains north of Peking (Beijing), looking toward Inner Mongolia, is the Great Wall. The largest\nman-made structure on earth, the 3,000 mile wall was begun in the third century B.C. It took over\n200 years to complete. The Peking area also offers such wondrous sights as the Ming Tombs, the\nForbidden City, the Great Hall, Chairman Mao's Memorial and the Temple of Heaven. Shanghai,\nSoochow (Suzhou), Hangchow (Hangzhou), and Canton (Guangzhou), among many other cities,\noffer equally breathtaking vistas\nA visit to the People's Republic of China is a unique and totally remarkable experience: now, only\n14 hours away on Pan Am's 747SP Clippers\nSPAN AM.\n205.045.119",
      "Cocktailo\nSherry Dubonnet Campari\nManhattan Gin Martini Vodka Martini\nVermouth\nBloody Mary Screwdriver Whiskey Sour\nTom Collins Vodka Collins Daiquiri Scotch Bourbon\nCanadian Gin Vodka Rum Premium Beer\nMenus\nApéritif\nDélices Gastronomiques\nSelected gourmet delicacies\nRôti au Vol\nA selected cut of aged beef\nroasted on board and carved to order\nVeau Marsala\nTender veal in a rich Marsala sauce\nCanard à l'Orange\nRoast duckling with brandy and orange liqueur sauce\nTurbot d'Antin\nPoached fillet of Turbot in white wine sauce with mushrooms, tomatoes and tarragon\nPlat du Jour\nSpecialty of the day\nPommes de Terre Maison\nPotatoes Maison\nLégumes au Beurre",
      "Canard a l'Orange\nRoast duckling with brandy and orange liqueur sauce\nTurbot d'Antin\nPoached fillet of Turbot in white wine sauce with mushrooms, tomatoes and tarragon\nPlat du Jour\nSpecialty of the day\nPommes de Terre Maison\nPotatoes Maison\nLegumes au Beurre\nButtered vegetable bouquet\nSalade Campagnarde\nTossed garden salad\nSélection de Fruits et Fromages\nSelected fruits and cheeses\nDessert\nCafé\nCoffee\nCafé Décaféiné\nDecaffeinated Coffee\nThé\nTea\nDrambuie\nSelected Red and White Wines\nChampagne Brut\nAmaretto di Saronno\nBénédictine\nCrème de Menthe Cognac VSOP\nCointreau\n224K457"
